{% assign shop_url = routes.all_products_collection_url %}
<section class="home-hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-sun">✳</span> From the earth. For your everyday.</p><h1>A little tradition.<br>A lot of <em>goodness.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Real seeds. Slowly pressed. Nothing extra.<br>Bring the goodness of nature back to your kitchen with our cold & wood pressed oils.</p><a href="{{ shop_url }}" class="button">Find your everyday oil {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow' %}</a><div class="hero-note">{% render 'icon', name: 'leaf' %}<span>Single pressed · Naturally settled · Made in India</span></div></div>
  <div class="hero-visual"><img src="{{ 'oorvi-hero-v4.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Oorvi groundnut and coconut oils with native peanuts and coconut in warm morning light" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high"><div class="hero-stamp"><span>JUST SEEDS.</span>{% render 'icon', name: 'drop' %}<span>JUST GOODNESS.</span></div><div class="photo-caption"><span>Goodness begins at the source.</span><span>01 / THE EVERYDAY ESSENTIAL</span></div></div>
</section>
<div class="goodness-strip"><span>{% render 'icon', name: 'leaf' %} Native seeds</span><span>{% render 'icon', name: 'drop' %} First & only pressing</span><span>{% render 'icon', name: 'sun' %} Naturally settled</span><span>{% render 'icon', name: 'leaf' %} No added preservatives</span></div>
<section class="shop-section section-space wrap" id="our-oils">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your pantry, a little purer</p><h2>Good food starts<br>with <em>good oil.</em></h2></div><div class="section-heading-side"><p>From your morning dosa to your family’s favourite curry.<br>There’s an Oorvi for every kind of cooking.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ shop_url }}">Explore all oils {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow' %}</a></div></div>
  <div class="filter-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Filter oils"><button class="active" data-oil-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All goodness</button><button data-oil-filter="cold" aria-pressed="false">Cold pressed</button><button data-oil-filter="wood" aria-pressed="false">Wood pressed</button></div>
  <div class="oil-grid">
    {% assign handles = 'cold-pressed-groundnut-oil,oorvi-cold-pressed-white-sesame-oil-500ml,wood-pressed-coconut-oil,cold-pressed-mustard' | split: ',' %}
    {% assign titles = 'Groundnut oil,White sesame oil,Coconut oil,Mustard oil' | split: ',' %}
    {% assign images = 'groundnut-cp.png,white-sesame-cp.png,coconut-wp.png,mustard-cp.png' | split: ',' %}
    {% assign notes = 'The everyday all-rounder,Nutty. Aromatic. Full of character,A little tropical goodness,Big flavour for bold cooking' | split: ',' %}
    {% for handle in handles %}{% assign i = forloop.index0 %}{% assign oil = all_products[handle] %}
    <article class="oil-card tone-{{ forloop.index }}" data-oil-type="{% if i == 2 %}wood{% else %}cold{% endif %}">
      <a class="oil-image" href="{% if oil != blank %}{{ oil.url }}{% else %}/products/{{ handle }}{% endif %}"><span class="product-kicker">{% if i == 2 %}Wood pressed{% else %}Cold pressed{% endif %}</span><img src="{{ images[i] | asset_url }}" alt="Oorvi {{ titles[i] }} bottle" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy"><span class="image-arrow">↗</span></a>
      <div class="oil-info"><h3><a href="{% if oil != blank %}{{ oil.url }}{% else %}/products/{{ handle }}{% endif %}">{{ titles[i] }}</a></h3><p>{{ notes[i] }}</p><div class="oil-buy"><span>{% if oil != blank %}{{ oil.price | money }} <small>/ {% if i == 1 %}500 mL{% else %}1 L{% endif %}</small>{% else %}Discover your daily essential{% endif %}</span><a class="small-button" href="{% if oil != blank %}{{ oil.url }}{% else %}/products/{{ handle }}{% endif %}" aria-label="Choose {{ titles[i] }}">Choose oil <span>+</span></a></div></div>
    </article>{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="process-section" id="our-process"><div class="process-grid wrap"><div class="process-photo"><img src="{{ 'oorvi-craft-v3.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Golden oil poured into a ceramic bowl with native seeds" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"><span class="photo-label">SLOW BY NATURE. GOOD BY CHOICE.</span></div><div class="process-copy"><p class="eyebrow">The Oorvi way</p><h2>Nothing rushed.<br>Nothing <em>unnecessary.</em></h2><p>Some things are better the way they’ve always been. We keep our process simple, so the seed’s own flavour does the talking.</p><div class="process-step"><span>01</span><div><h3>Start with good seeds.</h3><p>Carefully chosen native seeds. The beginning of every bottle.</p></div></div><div class="process-step"><span>02</span><div><h3>Press once. With patience.</h3><p>Cold or wood pressed, without refining or blending.</p></div></div><div class="process-step"><span>03</span><div><h3>Let nature do its thing.</h3><p>Naturally settled, then bottled. Just honest oil.</p></div></div><a href="{{ pages['our-story'].url | default: '/pages/our-story' }}" class="text-link">Get to know Oorvi {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow' %}</a></div></div></section>
<section class="finder-section section-space wrap" id="oil-finder"><div class="finder-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A good place to start</p><h2>Your kitchen.<br>Your kind of <em>oil.</em></h2><p>Every oil has its own personality.<br>Find the one that feels at home in your cooking.</p><div class="finder-buttons" role="group" aria-label="What do you love cooking?"><button data-finder="everyday" class="active" aria-pressed="true">Everyday cooking</button><button data-finder="traditional" aria-pressed="false">Traditional favourites</button><button data-finder="light" aria-pressed="false">Light & simple</button></div></div><div class="finder-result" aria-live="polite"><div class="finder-bottle"><img id="finder-image" src="{{ 'groundnut-cp.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Oorvi groundnut oil" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy"></div><div><span class="eyebrow" id="finder-tag">Meet your everyday companion</span><h3 id="finder-title">Groundnut oil</h3><p id="finder-description">A warm, nutty flavour that feels right at home in curries, stir-fries, and everyday Indian cooking.</p><a id="finder-link" href="/products/cold-pressed-groundnut-oil" class="text-link">Meet your match {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow' %}</a></div></div></section>
<section class="kitchen-banner wrap"><img src="{{ 'oorvi-kitchen-v3.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A sunlit Indian kitchen table with dosa, chutney, and a home-cooked meal" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"><div class="kitchen-copy"><p class="eyebrow">For meals. For memories.</p><h2>The everyday.<br>Made a little <em>better.</em></h2><p>Familiar flavours. A table full of stories.<br>Goodness belongs in the little things.</p><a class="button button-cream" href="{{ shop_url }}">Bring Oorvi home {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow' %}</a></div></section>
<section class="questions-section section-space wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">A little clarity</p><h2>Good questions.<br><em>Honest answers.</em></h2><a class="text-link" href="{{ pages['contact'].url | default: '/pages/contact' }}">Ask us anything {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow' %}</a></div><div class="questions"><details open><summary>What makes cold pressed oil different?<span>+</span></summary><p>Cold pressing extracts oil mechanically from seeds, without the refining, bleaching, and deodorising used for many refined oils. The seed’s natural aroma and character remain.</p></details><details><summary>Cold pressed or wood pressed?<span>+</span></summary><p>Our cold pressed oils use a steel expeller. Our wood pressed range uses a traditional slow-turning ghani. Both are single pressed and naturally settled. Choose by the flavour you enjoy and the meals you cook.</p></details><details><summary>Why does my oil look a little cloudy?<span>+</span></summary><p>Our oils are naturally settled. A little sediment or a change in colour can be part of their natural character. Coconut oil can also solidify in cooler temperatures.</p></details><details><summary>How should I store my bottle?<span>+</span></summary><p>Keep it tightly closed in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight. Follow the storage instructions and best-before date on your bottle.</p></details></div></section>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Oorvi — Goodness","settings":[]}
{% endschema %}
